          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 7:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abaana ba Ruhanga baareeba abaishiki b'abantu bari barungi; baashweramu abakazi boona abu baakunzire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira ati: Omwoyo wangye tariguma naahakana n'abantu ebiro byona; ahakuba n'abantu-buntu; kandi emyaka yaabo eryaba igana na makumi abiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro ebyo hakaba hariho abantu b'ebikaaka; kandi bwanyima y'ebyo abaana ba Ruhanga ku baashweire bahara b'abantu, baabazaaraho abaana; abaana abo nibo bantu b'amaani aba ira abaarangainwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
